OL,3,GNEWSAAssembly Rooms demolition given
OL,4,Afinal approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to demolish Derby's empty Assembly
OL,7,FRooms could start in 2027, after plans
OL,8,Ffor the project were given final
OL,9,Fapproval.
OL,11,FThe building in Derby city centre has
OL,12,Fbeen closed for more than 10 years
OL,13,Ffollowing a serious fire. Plans to
OL,14,Fregenerate the area have been in the
OL,15,Fpipeline ever since.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, Derby City Council's
OL,18,FPlanning Control Committee gave the
OL,19,Ffinal green light, allowing the
OL,20,Fbuilding to be demolished next year.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
