OL,3,GNEWSAAssembly Rooms demolition given
OL,4,Afinal approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will make way for a new multi-use
OL,7,Fbuilding featuring a music venue,
OL,8,Fcultural/exhibition space, library,
OL,9,Fworking space and meeting areas `
OL,10,Fincluding a rooftop bar - after plans
OL,11,Fwere approved in July.
